":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1322139004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"好的。虽然我还是有些颤抖……但我和马克西姆兄弟已经向女...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1322139005:1":{"key":"say:7:1322139005:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1322139005","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"很好。卡列琳娜，你一直都是虔诚的信徒，等到净化开始的时...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1322139006:1":{"key":"say:8:1322139006:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1322139006","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"放心吧，瓦丽卡姐姐。我明白该怎么做。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:10:1322139007:0":{"key":"say:10:1322139007:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1322139007","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:11:1322139008:1":{"key":"say:11:1322139008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1322139008","act